{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/ec3-epd-guide/layout,_N_T_/ec3-epd-guide/page,_N_T_/ec3-epd-guide"},"segmentPaths":["/_tree","/_full","/_index","/ec3-epd-guide/__PAGE__"],"prefetchHints":{"hints":0,"slots":{"children":{"hints":64,"slots":{"children":{"hints":160,"slots":null}}}}}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/83afe278b6a6bb3c-s.p.2bn3s6zvc0dyp.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/23xh-7wmp-5d8.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/1my_3qt7cqmy3.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/17780b3h29lu-.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/31-h9b0ngcdl_.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/turbopack-3t98u8doi58w_.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/1icgbrcdew2yz.js\" async=\"\" crossorigin=\"\"></script><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><title>EC3 EPD Guide: Search, Match &amp; Use Material Data | Green Engineering Tools</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Learn how to search EC3 EPD data, fix BIM material names, review declared units and connect product-level embodied carbon data to a whole-building LCA workflow.\"/><link rel=\"author\" href=\"https://greenengineeringtools.com\"/><meta name=\"author\" content=\"Engr. Arsalan Khan\"/><meta name=\"creator\" content=\"Green Engineering Tools\"/><meta name=\"publisher\" content=\"Green Engineering Tools\"/><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\"/><meta name=\"googlebot\" content=\"index, follow, max-video-preview:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1\"/><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://greenengineeringtools.com/ec3-epd-guide\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"EC3 EPD Guide: Search, Match &amp; Use Material Data\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Learn how to search EC3 EPD data, fix BIM material names, review declared units and connect product-level embodied carbon data to a whole-building LCA workflow.\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://greenengineeringtools.com/ec3-epd-guide\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Free Embodied Carbon Calculator | Green Engineering Tools\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Calculate embodied carbon from construction quantities, EPD data and lifecycle modules.\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg?icon.1vgxlfe3lamf-.svg\" sizes=\"any\" type=\"image/svg+xml\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"inter_5972bc34-module__OU16Qa__className flex min-h-screen w-full min-w-0 flex-col overflow-x-hidden bg-slate-50 text-slate-900\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><header class=\"sticky top-0 z-50 w-full border-b border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-sm\"><nav aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-3 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"flex h-16 min-w-0 items-center justify-between gap-2 sm:h-20 sm:gap-4\"><a aria-label=\"Green Engineering Tools home\" class=\"flex min-w-0 max-w-[calc(100%-3.25rem)] items-center sm:max-w-none\" href=\"/\"><div class=\"mr-2 shrink-0 rounded-lg bg-emerald-500 p-1.5 shadow-inner shadow-emerald-700/50 sm:mr-3 sm:p-2\"><svg class=\"h-6 w-6 text-white sm:h-7 sm:w-7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" d=\"M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"min-w-0 truncate text-[15px] font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 min-[360px]:text-base sm:text-2xl\">GreenEngineering<span class=\"text-emerald-600\">LCA</span></span></a><div class=\"hidden items-center gap-5 lg:flex xl:gap-6\"><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-emerald-600\" href=\"/\">The Engine</a><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-emerald-600\" href=\"/cbam-calculator\">CBAM Estimator</a><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-emerald-600\" href=\"/guides\">Guides</a><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-emerald-600\" href=\"/methodology\">Methodology</a><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-emerald-600\" href=\"/about\">About</a><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-emerald-600\" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap rounded-md bg-slate-900 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-md transition-colors hover:bg-slate-800\" href=\"/#calculator-workspace\">Launch Workspace</a></div><div class=\"lg:hidden shrink-0\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Open navigation menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobile-navigation-panel\" class=\"inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl text-slate-700 transition-colors hover:bg-slate-100 hover:text-emerald-700 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-emerald-500 focus-visible:ring-offset-2\"><svg class=\"h-7 w-7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" d=\"M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16\"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></nav></header><main class=\"w-full min-w-0 flex-1 overflow-x-clip\"><main class=\"min-h-screen bg-slate-50\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"TechArticle\",\"headline\":\"EC3 EPD Guide: Search, Match & Use Material Data\",\"description\":\"Learn how to search EC3 EPD data, fix BIM material names, review declared units and connect product-level embodied carbon data to a whole-building LCA workflow.\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-08-31\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":\"https://greenengineeringtools.com/ec3-epd-guide\",\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Green Engineering Tools\",\"url\":\"https://greenengineeringtools.com\"},\"about\":[\"Life cycle assessment\",\"Embodied carbon\",\"Environmental Product Declarations\",\"Building materials\"]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://greenengineeringtools.com\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Guides\",\"item\":\"https://greenengineeringtools.com/guides\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"EC3 EPD Guide: Search, Match & Use Material Data\",\"item\":\"https://greenengineeringtools.com/ec3-epd-guide\"}]}</script><section class=\"bg-slate-950 text-white\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-14 sm:py-20\"><nav class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 mb-7\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><a class=\"hover:text-white\" href=\"/\">Home</a><span class=\"mx-2\">/</span><a class=\"hover:text-white\" href=\"/guides\">Guides</a></nav><p class=\"text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-emerald-300\">EC3 material and EPD workflow</p><h1 class=\"mt-4 max-w-5xl text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black tracking-tight\">EC3 EPD Guide: Search, Match &amp; Use Material Data</h1><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-4xl text-lg sm:text-xl leading-8 text-slate-300\">Learn how to search EC3 EPD data, fix BIM material names, review declared units and connect product-level embodied carbon data to a whole-building LCA workflow.</p><div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-emerald-500 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-black text-white hover:bg-emerald-400\" href=\"/#calculator-workspace\">Open the LCA calculator</a><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-slate-700 bg-slate-900 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-800\" href=\"/methodology\">Read methodology</a></div><p class=\"mt-6 text-xs text-slate-500\">Last reviewed: <!-- -->2026-08-31</p></div></section><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 sm:py-16 grid lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_280px] gap-10\"><article class=\"min-w-0\"><div class=\"space-y-14\"><section id=\"what\" class=\"scroll-mt-24\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950\">What EC3 is and where it fits in an LCA workflow</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-[1.02rem] leading-8 text-slate-700\">EC3, the Embodied Carbon in Construction Calculator from Building Transparency, is a free construction-specific material search and planning tool backed by a large database of digital third-party EPDs. Building Transparency describes EC3 as a tool for finding and comparing materials, planning embodied-carbon reductions and supporting procurement.</p><p class=\"mt-4 text-[1.02rem] leading-8 text-slate-700\">EC3 and whole-building LCA are related but not identical. Building Transparency&#x27;s own documentation distinguishes upfront carbon assessment from whole-life impact assessment. A whole-building LCA may include future replacement, use-stage and end-of-life effects in addition to product-stage carbon.</p></section><section id=\"search\" class=\"scroll-mt-24\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950\">How to search EC3 when the BIM name is wrong or too specific</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-[1.02rem] leading-8 text-slate-700\">A model name such as &#x27;Concrete (Cast-in-Place) - 4000psi - Level 2&#x27; may not match the wording used by an EPD record. Instead of forcing users to edit the source schedule, the calculator gives the EC3 search term its own editable field.</p><p class=\"mt-4 text-[1.02rem] leading-8 text-slate-700\">Start with the most meaningful product description, then simplify if results are poor. Remove level names, internal family codes and irrelevant punctuation. Keep performance information such as concrete strength or steel grade when it helps distinguish functionally different products.</p><ol class=\"mt-5 space-y-3 list-decimal pl-6 text-slate-700 leading-7\"><li>Keep the original BIM/CSV alias unchanged.</li><li>Search using the original name first.</li><li>If results are poor, edit only the EC3 search term.</li><li>Select the EPD that best matches product type, specification, geography and declared unit.</li><li>Preserve the approved alias-to-EPD mapping for future imports only when your EC3 access terms allow storage.</li></ol></section><section id=\"fields\" class=\"scroll-mt-24\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950\">What to review before selecting an EC3 EPD</h2><ul class=\"mt-5 space-y-3 list-disc pl-6 text-slate-700 leading-7\"><li>Product name and manufacturer.</li><li>Product category and performance attributes.</li><li>Declared quantity and unit.</li><li>A1-A3 GWP and any other declared lifecycle modules.</li><li>Plant or geographic relevance where available.</li><li>EPD validity and program information.</li><li>Whether the candidate represents a product-specific EPD, industry average or another data type.</li></ul></section><section id=\"integration\" class=\"scroll-mt-24\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950\">How the Green Engineering Tools EC3 reconciliation works</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-[1.02rem] leading-8 text-slate-700\">The frontend first checks its local and shared material mappings. If the material is unresolved, the user can search the EC3-connected backend. The selected result is normalized into the LCA data structure while missing modules remain missing.</p><p class=\"mt-4 text-[1.02rem] leading-8 text-slate-700\">When the returned result contains a usable openEPD identifier, the backend can request the detailed digital EPD record before calculation. This prevents the application from reducing an EPD to only a name and one GWP number when richer data is available.</p></section><section id=\"permissions\" class=\"scroll-mt-24\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950\">API access and data-storage permissions matter</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-[1.02rem] leading-8 text-slate-700\">An API connection does not automatically grant unlimited rights to cache or redistribute the provider&#x27;s data. Production SaaS applications should follow the current Building Transparency API terms and the permissions attached to their access level.</p><p class=\"mt-4 text-[1.02rem] leading-8 text-slate-700\">For that reason, the backend uses an explicit EC3 persistence flag. The calculator can use a selected record for the current analysis while persistent shared storage remains disabled until the application&#x27;s EC3 agreement permits caching or reuse.</p><div class=\"mt-6 rounded-xl border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50 p-5\"><h3 class=\"font-black text-amber-950\">Technical capability and data rights are separate questions</h3><p class=\"mt-2 leading-7 text-amber-900\">A database can technically store an EPD response, but a production SaaS should only enable that behavior when its data-access agreement permits it.</p></div></section><section id=\"ec3-vs-lca\" class=\"scroll-mt-24\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950\">EC3 material comparison versus whole-building LCA</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-[1.02rem] leading-8 text-slate-700\">EC3 is particularly strong for material specification and procurement because EPD data can reveal differences between products that meet similar performance needs. A whole-building LCA adds a system-level view: how much material is used, how long products last, what is replaced, what happens at end of life and how design alternatives compare.</p><p class=\"mt-4 text-[1.02rem] leading-8 text-slate-700\">Using EC3 as a material-data workflow inside a broader LCA engine can connect procurement detail to the building-level decision without pretending that an EPD search alone is a complete whole-life assessment.</p></section></div><section class=\"mt-16 border-t border-slate-200 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-slate-950\">Frequently asked questions</h2><div class=\"mt-6 space-y-3\"><details class=\"group rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none p-5 font-black text-slate-900 flex gap-4 justify-between\"><span>Is EC3 a free embodied carbon database?</span><span class=\"text-emerald-600 group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span></summary><div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-slate-700 leading-7\">Building Transparency describes EC3 as a free, open-access construction embodied-carbon tool with a large digital EPD database. API integration and production data rights can have separate terms.</div></details><details class=\"group rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none p-5 font-black text-slate-900 flex gap-4 justify-between\"><span>Why can&#x27;t I find my exact Revit material name in EC3?</span><span class=\"text-emerald-600 group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span></summary><div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-slate-700 leading-7\">BIM names often contain internal naming conventions that do not match EPD product names. Simplify or correct the search term while preserving the original model alias.</div></details><details class=\"group rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none p-5 font-black text-slate-900 flex gap-4 justify-between\"><span>Does selecting an EC3 EPD automatically make the whole-building LCA correct?</span><span class=\"text-emerald-600 group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span></summary><div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-slate-700 leading-7\">No. The EPD still has to match the material and declared unit, and the project must define quantities, lifecycle scope, transport, service life and other assumptions.</div></details><details class=\"group rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none p-5 font-black text-slate-900 flex gap-4 justify-between\"><span>Can the SaaS remember an approved EC3 match for the next user?</span><span class=\"text-emerald-600 group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span></summary><div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-slate-700 leading-7\">Technically yes through a shared alias mapping, but persistent EC3 storage should only be enabled when your Building Transparency access agreement permits caching or reuse.</div></details></div></section><section class=\"mt-14 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-black text-slate-950\">Authoritative references</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">These links are provided for readers who want to verify standards, product data terminology, or certification requirements at the source.</p><ul class=\"mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm\"><li><a href=\"https://www.buildingtransparency.org/tools/ec3/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"font-bold text-blue-700 hover:underline\">Building Transparency — EC3 tool</a></li><li><a href=\"https://docs.buildingtransparency.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"font-bold text-blue-700 hover:underline\">Building Transparency documentation — EC3 and tallyLCA scope</a></li><li><a href=\"https://docs.buildingtransparency.org/ec3/main-features/find-and-compare-materials\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"font-bold text-blue-700 hover:underline\">Building Transparency — Find &amp; Compare Materials</a></li></ul></section><section class=\"mt-14\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-black text-slate-950\">Continue learning</h2><div class=\"mt-5 grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4\"><a class=\"rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-sm transition\" href=\"/epd-carbon-calculator\"><h3 class=\"font-black text-slate-950\">EPD carbon calculator</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">Learn how to read EPD units, GWP values, declared modules and data limitations.</p></a><a class=\"rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-sm transition\" href=\"/bim-embodied-carbon\"><h3 class=\"font-black text-slate-950\">BIM embodied carbon workflow</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">Prepare Revit or BIM quantities for material mapping and lifecycle carbon analysis.</p></a><a class=\"rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-sm transition\" href=\"/embodied-carbon-calculator\"><h3 class=\"font-black text-slate-950\">Embodied carbon calculator guide</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">Learn how to turn a construction material schedule into an auditable carbon result.</p></a><a class=\"rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-sm transition\" href=\"/whole-building-lca\"><h3 class=\"font-black text-slate-950\">Whole-building LCA guide</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">Understand scope, service life, baseline comparison and whole-life reporting.</p></a></div></section></article><aside class=\"hidden lg:block\"><div class=\"sticky top-24 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5\"><h2 class=\"text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-500\">On this page</h2><nav class=\"mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm\"><a href=\"#what\" class=\"block font-semibold leading-5 text-slate-700 hover:text-emerald-700\">What EC3 is and where it fits in an LCA workflow</a><a href=\"#search\" class=\"block font-semibold leading-5 text-slate-700 hover:text-emerald-700\">How to search EC3 when the BIM name is wrong or too specific</a><a href=\"#fields\" class=\"block font-semibold leading-5 text-slate-700 hover:text-emerald-700\">What to review before selecting an EC3 EPD</a><a href=\"#integration\" class=\"block font-semibold leading-5 text-slate-700 hover:text-emerald-700\">How the Green Engineering Tools EC3 reconciliation works</a><a href=\"#permissions\" class=\"block font-semibold leading-5 text-slate-700 hover:text-emerald-700\">API access and data-storage permissions matter</a><a href=\"#ec3-vs-lca\" class=\"block font-semibold leading-5 text-slate-700 hover:text-emerald-700\">EC3 material comparison versus whole-building LCA</a><a href=\"#top\" class=\"block pt-3 border-t border-slate-100 font-bold text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-700\">Back to top</a></nav></div></aside></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"mt-auto w-full border-t border-slate-800 bg-slate-950 text-slate-400\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 sm:py-14 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 text-center sm:grid-cols-2 sm:text-left lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-8\"><div class=\"sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center sm:justify-start\" href=\"/\"><svg class=\"mr-2 h-7 w-7 shrink-0 text-emerald-500\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" d=\"M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4\"></path></svg><span class=\"font-black tracking-tight text-white\">GreenEngineering Tools</span></a><p class=\"mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xs text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400 sm:mx-0\">Browser-based tools and practical guides for embodied carbon, EPD data, BIM material workflows and whole-building life-cycle assessment.</p><a class=\"mt-5 inline-flex text-sm font-black text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300\" href=\"/#calculator-workspace\">Open LCA calculator →</a></div><div><h2 class=\"text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-white\">Tools</h2><nav class=\"mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm\" aria-label=\"Footer tools navigation\"><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/\">LCA Engine</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/cbam-calculator\">CBAM Estimator</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/cbam-calculator/actual-data\">Actual / Complex Goods</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/cbam-calculator/electricity\">CBAM Electricity</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/cbam-calculator/bulk\">Official Bulk CSV</a></nav></div><div><h2 class=\"text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-white\">Learn</h2><nav class=\"mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm\" aria-label=\"Footer learning navigation\"><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/embodied-carbon-calculator\">Embodied Carbon Calculator</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/a1-a3-embodied-carbon\">A1-A3 Embodied Carbon</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/epd-carbon-calculator\">EPD Carbon Calculator</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/ec3-epd-guide\">EC3 EPD Guide</a></nav></div><div><h2 class=\"text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-white\">More Guides</h2><nav class=\"mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm\" aria-label=\"Footer additional guides\"><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/bim-embodied-carbon\">BIM Embodied Carbon</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/whole-building-lca\">Whole-Building LCA</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/module-d-lca\">Module D Explained</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/leed-whole-building-lca\"